-- FMS Round: more check items for the central forms, chosen from the reference files the owner sent on 2026-11-15
-- (JCI FMS audit checklist, JCI 8th FMS standards / 7th-vs-8th / handbook, QA-QS engineering audit checklists,
--  FMS tracer findings, JCI meeting minutes, utility occurrence reports, BCP playbook, chiller operation log).
-- Additive: 117 new rows in the central forms (hospital_id null): doc 57 · walk 43 · tracer 17.
-- A hospital that uploaded its own form keeps it unchanged. Saved results keep their own copy of each item, so nothing saved changes.
-- Standards that have no ME number in the 76-ME list get a standard-level code (me = 0) so reports can group them.

